.env

# Frontend bundle: a build result (cmd/webbuild). The .gitkeep stays, or go:embed
# in web/embed.go does not build.
web/dist/*
!web/dist/.gitkeep

# Bytecode python writes on any import of the agent.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Playwright screenshots from live checks.
.playwright-mcp/

# Binaries built by `go build` without -o: the package name matches the module
# name, so they land in the root.
/aacpanel
/monitor-exec

# Notes, settings and instructions of one installation: paths, names and habits
# of a single machine. Listed here and not only in the global ignore, which a
# clone on another machine does not have.
.claude/
.codex/
.agents/
.remember/
CLAUDE.md

# AGENTS.md is the exception: it is about working with this code, not about one
# installation. The negation is required, since the global ignore hides it by
# name.
!AGENTS.md
